From: =?UTF-8?q?Matthias=20M=C3=BCnch?= <claude@djbase.de>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:11:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] use ENVARC:ssh instead of envarc:.ssh on the Amiga

Keys, known_hosts, ssh_config, authorized_keys and the random seed now
live in ENVARC:ssh, the usual Amiga form and the directory bebbosshd
already uses for its own files. getSshDotDir() (home.cpp) resolves it
once; if only the old envarc:.ssh exists, that one is still used, so
existing installations keep working until the directory is renamed.
